{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/dc209fe0e0eda02292030826cc37c882.avif?t=1755983412\" width=600 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u201cScreaming In The Basement\u201d\u00a0</strong></i> is a psychological thriller from the first person, unfolding through tense silence and detailed sound design that builds a growing sense of unease. This game is inspired by P.T.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Average Playtime: 200 - 230 minutes</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/f62f8cd2256a850e23c5bc82a399b8ee.poster.avif?t=1755983412\" width=664 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/f62f8cd2256a850e23c5bc82a399b8ee.webm?t=1755983412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/f62f8cd2256a850e23c5bc82a399b8ee.mp4?t=1755983412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WARNING: This game contains flashing lights and visual effects that may trigger seizures in people with photosensitive epilepsy.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/34747ee8bcfef3e34e458e0288d332f6.poster.avif?t=1755983412\" width=664 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/34747ee8bcfef3e34e458e0288d332f6.webm?t=1755983412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/34747ee8bcfef3e34e458e0288d332f6.mp4?t=1755983412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR STORY BEGINS, THEIR FATE UNFOLDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mike is the main character, a journalist driven by a thirst for uncovering deep, hidden truths. He gains access to an apartment where, according to locals, restless souls are said to haunt the place. This is a fact that still needs to be confirmed, tied to a terrible incident. A family consisting of a father, mother, and daughter once lived in the apartment and were killed by someone whose identity remains unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1990, a family bought a house in Russia from Robert. After hearing strange noises from the basement and a curse, they left and moved to New York, they rented apartment from Norman Harold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sarah often heard strange whispers and scratching sounds coming from below. Sometimes, it sounded like someone was calling her name. She tried to tell her parents, but they dismissed her fears, saying it was just the old place settling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/57a5e485f4c4c29108d1e624c456f2c0.poster.avif?t=1755983412\" width=664 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/57a5e485f4c4c29108d1e624c456f2c0.webm?t=1755983412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/57a5e485f4c4c29108d1e624c456f2c0.mp4?t=1755983412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN INTENSE, IMMERSIVE JOURNEY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre</strong><br>&quot;Walking Simulator&quot; focused on story, exploration, and atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong><br>Three different endings unfold depending on the choices you make. Can you find the truth behind what\u2019s happening, or will you lose yourself to the darkness around you?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Style</strong><br>Aesthetic inspired by the 1990s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Mechanic</strong><br>You\u2019ll carry a powerful Polaroid camera that lets you capture hidden horrors, things invisible to the naked eye, and reveal the dark truths hidden within the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound Design</strong><br>The immersive sound design pulls you deeper into the experience, building tension at every moment until you\u2019re fully surrounded by a growing sense of madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paranormal Elements</strong><br>Paranormal activity makes objects move and causes the environment to change in strange and unexpected ways, making you feel something beyond this world is present.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration Focus</strong><br>Move slowly through each area, searching for secrets, reading notes, and finding clues that help you understand the story bit by bit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice and Consequence</strong><br>Your actions, choices, and recordings determine how the story unfolds through a disturbing supernatural history.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/4e97b1e12d225e0c6c9e7ac7333a78ea.poster.avif?t=1755983412\" width=664 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/4e97b1e12d225e0c6c9e7ac7333a78ea.webm?t=1755983412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/4e97b1e12d225e0c6c9e7ac7333a78ea.mp4?t=1755983412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GRIPPING CINEMATIC EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkness creeps in every corner, and silence hides the screams. The intense psychological horror into madness, the game draws you into a cinematic nightmare where every moment feels like a scene from your worst horror film, and the truth you\u2019re searching for may be the very thing that destroys you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/e68f6e36e285138e37ebf60e90cf0797.poster.avif?t=1755983412\" width=664 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/e68f6e36e285138e37ebf60e90cf0797.webm?t=1755983412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/e68f6e36e285138e37ebf60e90cf0797.mp4?t=1755983412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE BASEMENT AWAITS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath these floors lies a darkness that never sleeps. One wrong step, and you\u2019ll be swallowed whole, trapped forever in its relentless nightmare.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3441360?t=1755983412","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a